# Title: Local Groups Discovery - Linux
# ID: 676381a6-15ca-4d73-a9c8-6a22e970b90d
# Status: test
# Level: low
# Author: Ömer Günal, Alejandro Ortuno, oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-11
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1069.001
# Description: Detects enumeration of local system groups. Adversaries may attempt to find local system groups and permission settings
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* sourcetype="syslog" ((process_path="*/groups") OR ((process_path="*/cat" OR process_path="*/ed" OR process_path="*/head" OR process_path="*/less" OR process_path="*/more" OR process_path="*/nano" OR process_path="*/tail" OR process_path="*/vi" OR process_path="*/vim") AND process_exec="*/etc/group*"))
